OL,3,AChris Mason: Budget felt cautious
OL,4,Adespite its range of small measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis was a Budget I would describe as a
OL,7,Fflotilla of small measures.
OL,9,FWestminster is poring over the 150 page
OL,10,FRed Book in which the Budget is printed
OL,11,Fand also what is formally called the
OL,12,FEconomic and Fiscal Outlook published
OL,13,Fby the watchdog and forecaster the
OL,14,FOffice for Budget Responsibility, the
OL,15,FOBR.
OL,17,FThe Red Book sets out the measures the
OL,18,Fchancellor will implement and how much
OL,19,Fthey will cost. There are 98 of them,
OL,20,Fconsiderably more than normal and more
OL,21,Fthan in either of Rachel Reeves'
OL,22,Fbudgets.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
